! Welcome to your TiddlyWiki

This is a sample tiddler. The metadata header above (everything before
the first blank line) is parsed by TiddlyWiki; the body below it is
the tiddler's content in WikiText (TiddlyWiki's native markup).

! What's a tiddler?

A tiddler is the smallest unit of content. Think of it as a card with
a title, tags, and a body. Tiddlers link to and transclude each other.

